      "description": "Three aims. One quiet rhythm.\n\nThreeAims is a tiny habit assistant for days when a long to-do list feels too heavy. Choose exactly three small aims, then give one of them your attention with a 5, 10, or 25-minute focus session.\n\nSee the remaining time on your Lock Screen and Dynamic Island. Each finished focus session becomes a small dot in today’s view and calendar—a gentle reminder that progress happened.\n\n• Exactly three aims each day\n• 5, 10, and 25-minute focus timer\n• Live Activities on the Lock Screen and Dynamic Island\n• Midday and evening checkpoints\n• Optional local reminders\n• Calendar history and Home Screen widgets\n• No account, ads, or analytics\n\nYour aims and history stay on your device. Start small, finish one thing, and let visible small wins nudge you toward tomorrow.\n\nThe app interface is currently in English.",
